    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Independent type foundry founded by Gayaneh Bagdasaryan and Vyacheslav Kirilenko, based in Moscow, Russia (prior entry said Germany; corrected from Behance/MyFonts which both list Moscow). Specializes in Latin and Cyrillic typefaces (21+ families incl. Aeroport, Wermut, Activist, Formular, Geometria, Brutal Type). Established, well-regarded foundry with a long catalogue; running it since the early 2010s suggests senior, fully autonomous principals. Type design house, Autonomy 5 as an independent foundry. Country corrected via Behance/MyFonts. Instagram found: @brownfoxtype (https://www.instagram.com/brownfoxtype/, verified via Behance profile). Sanity/Next.js site prefetches images globally; scraper --render caused DOM contamination on typeface pages, so Formular/Geometria/Wermut/Activist specimens sourced from Behance galleries instead.",
